● Vercel me redeployment tab khud-ba-khud shuru hoti hai jab aapka project
  GitHub se connect hota hai. Jab aap git push karte hain, GitHub Vercel ko ek
  signal (webhook) bhejta hai ke "Naya code aaya hai, ab isse deploy karo."

  Agar aapke Vercel dashboard par kuch nahi ho raha, toh iska matlab hai ke ya
  toh project connect nahi hai, ya phir koi issue hai.

  Aap ye check karein:

  1. Vercel Dashboard open karein: https://vercel.com/dashboard
  2. Apne Portfolio project par click karein.
  3. Upar "Deployments" tab par click karein.
  4. Dekhein wahan koi "Building" ya "Ready" status wala naya deployment dikh
     raha hai?

  ---

  🛠️ Agar wahan kuch nahi ho raha, toh manually redeploy karein:

  Agar auto-deployment kaam nahi kar rahi, toh aap ye karein:

  1. Project ke andar "Deployments" tab me jayein.
  2. Jo purana (failed) deployment hai, uske side me three dots (...) honge.
  3. Wahan "Redeploy" par click karein.
  4. Ek popup aayega, wahan "Redeploy" button daba dein.

  Yeh manually build trigger kar dega aur is baar force-dynamic ki wajah se 
  error nahi aana chahiye.

  Ek baar check karke batayein ke "Deployments" tab me kya status hai!

