● I have now completed the Advanced Animation Polish across the entire site!
  🎨✨

  🛠️ What I've implemented:

  1. Hero Section:
  - Added a Spring Transition to the main heading, making it bounce gently into
    place.

  2. Projects Section:
  - Header Animation: The "Featured Projects" title now slides down and the
    underline expands from the center.
  - Staggered Entry: The project cards no longer appear all at once. They now
    use a staggerChildren effect—each card pops up one after another with a
    slight delay.
  - Premium Motion: Added a scale and spring effect to the cards, so they "pop"
    into view as you scroll.

  3. Experience Section:
  - Slide-from-Left: Instead of just fading in, the experience items now slide
    in from the left (x: -30), creating a timeline-flow feel.
  - Viewport Trigger: Animations only start when the item is 50px inside the
    screen (margin: "-50px"), ensuring the user actually sees the movement.
  - Spring Physics: Added spring damping to the timeline items for a smoother,
    more professional motion.

  🧪 How to test:

  1. Restart your server (npm run dev).
  2. Refresh your browser.
  3. Scroll down slowly. You will see the projects and experiences "wake up" and
     slide into place as you reach them.

  This is the "Wow" factor! Do these animations feel right to you, or should we 
  adjust the speed/style? 😊

